Modifications
-------------
This fork includes the following modifications from the original WrenAI:

- Custom branding (NucleAI) and Portuguese-language documentation
- Self-hosted Langfuse v3 integration for LLM observability
- Runtime LLM configuration via UI (writes to .env.runtime and config.yaml)
- "Skip AI re-indexing" toggle to reduce OpenAI token costs during development
- AWS ECS/EC2 Terraform deployment manifests
- Additional chart types (heatmap, scatter) and UI refinements
- Custom green theme
- API Management improvements
- AWS deployment infrastructure (Terraform)

